Understand the page object differences

SimpleHomepgae vs a SimpleProductPage

//SimpleHomepgae:

Handles the 'browsing' experience

Responsible for: 

- Navigating to the Home Page 
- Clicking categories
- Selecting products from the list
- Going to the cart

//SimpleProductsPage:

-Handles the "product interaction"  experience

Responsible for:

- Getting product details
- Adding product to the cart
- Handling add-to-cart alerts

Why is this important? Speciically referring to the seperation
- Each page object has a sinlgle responsibility
- Makes code more maintable and easier to understand ***********
- Follows the principle of seperation of concerns
- Mirrors real-world shopping behaviour